        <mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;i&gt;An illustration with generic invoices, not Charles River&#x27;s. Dashed amber: the comparison with the source Table in CharlesRiver.xlsx, which is outside the import. A control total checks the import against itself; a count of the source checks the import against the source.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="336" width="860" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
